# Stillwater Terraces (CIPlay stillwater_terraces): The Lullaby Frequency's fifth island, quest "The Planting Song".
# Terraces at 3, 7, 11 m (centres z -38, -22, -6) and the altar's 15 m (z 12), a path up the middle (x 0); the paddies'
# water either side (|x| 1.5..13.5, z centre +-3); the statue sets on z 5 (st_a), -1 (st_b), -17 (st_c); the Bell stones
# at 16.5 -42, -16.5 -26, 16.5 -10, the stand at 2.8 -10; the altar platform x -4.5..4.5, z 8..12.5 (2.42 m up).
island Stillwater Terraces
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Planting Song
wait 3
expect shown st_a
expect hidden st_b
expect hidden st_c
expect hidden altarstair
walk 0 -56 to 0 -44 to 0 -40 h=3
zone paddy1
expect step 1
read Planting song
expect step 2
use bellstone1
walk 0 -40 to 0 -30 to 0 -24 h=7
zone paddy2
expect hidden st_a
expect shown st_b
expect step 3
use bellstone2
use bellstand
expect message Three hollows
use bellstone3
expect story bellstone 3
# (step 5, not 4: the stand is inside paddy 3's zone, so using it on the way already counts the climb)
expect step 5
walk 0 -24 to 0 -14 to 0 -8 h=11
zone paddy3
expect shown st_c
expect hidden st_b
expect shown terracefog
expect step 5
use bellstand
expect story bellsset 1
expect shown altarstair
expect step 6
kill Bear
expect step 7
walk 0 -4 to 0 4.5 h=15
read Monk's confession
expect step 8
open Offering box
expect item FishingRod_Metal 1
expect step 9
zone altar
expect hidden st_c
expect shown st_b
expect done
